<title>USA: OptimumCare sees higher Q3 profits.</title>
<headline>OptimumCare sees higher Q3 profits.</headline>
<dateline>LAGUNA NIGUEL, Calif. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>OptimumCare Corp said on Thursday it anticipates a significant increase in third quarter net profits compared to the year-ago period.</p>
<p>The company also said in a statement it expects record revenues for its third quarter, ended September 30, in excess of $2.75 million.</p>
<p>OptimumCare provides management services for a wide range of inpatient and outpatient mental health services.</p>
</text>
